  "trigger_name": "Citizen Review Panels",
  "summary_html": "**CAPTA §5106a(c)** requires every state to maintain **Citizen Review Panels** that evaluate CPS policies. Project Milk Carton checks whether panels are active, independent, and publicly reporting. Separately from the CAPTA panels, Michigan’s Office of the Child Advocate (OCA) — an independent state agency, renamed from the Office of Children’s Ombudsman by 2023 Public Act 303 on 12 December 2023 — reviews complaints about how Children’s Protective Services, foster care, adoption services, child placing agencies, group homes and facilities handled a case: michigan.gov/oca, 1-800-642-4326 (517-241-0400 in the Lansing area).",
  "authority_html": "- **CAPTA (42 U.S.C. § 5106a(c))** — Citizen Review Panel mandate and reporting requirements",
